(A switch executes statements from the matching case label onward until it reaches break\054 return\054 or the end of the) Tj
T*
(switch\056 If a break is omitted\054 execution falls through into the next case\056 In this program each case returns) Tj
T*
(immediately\054 so a missing break after a return has no effect because return exits the function\056 If the cases used) Tj
